{"sha": "8f347f0e4688799bc18ad1e39b698353e3bb1c7bbc3bb891f56306a278fb0086", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "$10\\log_{10}(kI/I_0) = 10\\log_{10}(I/I_0) + 10\\log_{10}k$;", "距离情形：见\\cref{prop:g12:sound-acoustics:inverse-square}，$k = 1/4$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[分贝运算]\\label{met:g12:sound-acoustics:db}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $L = 10\\log_{10}(I/I_0)$；反过来，$I = I_0 \\times 10^{L/10}$。", "  \\item 切勿直接相加声强级：先化为声强，相加，再化回", "        --- 或每加倍增加 $+\\qty{3}{dB}$，每增大十倍增加 $+\\qty{10}{dB}$。", "  \\item 小声源距离每加倍，声强级减少 \\qty{6}{dB}。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\fill[omThm!12] (4.25,-0.14) rectangle (7.35,0.14);", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.3,0) -- (7.7,0);", "  \\foreach \\x/\\l in {0/0, 1/20, 2/40, 3/60, 4/80, 5/100, 6/120, 7/140}", "    \\draw (\\x,0.07) -- (\\x,-0.07) node[below] {\\l};", "  \\node[below] at (7.55,-0.07) {\\unit{dB}};", "  \\foreach \\x/\\y/\\t in {0/0.4/threshold, 1.5/0.95/whisper,", "      3/0.4/conversation, 4/0.95/{busy street}, 5.25/0.4/concert,", "      6/0.95/pain, 7/0.4/{jet at takeoff}}", "    \\draw[omDef] (\\x,0.14) -- (\\x,\\y) node[above] {\\t};", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (4.25,-0.14) -- (4.25,0.14);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 日常声级阶梯：每个 \\qty{20}{dB} 的台阶，", "对应声强相差百倍；超过 \\qty{85}{dB}（红色区域）", "的暴露会损伤听力。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[听力损伤]\\label{rem:g12:sound-acoustics:damage}", "听力损失取决于剂量：\\qty{85}{dB} 下可安全接触八小时，而", "每增加 \\qty{3}{dB}（即声强加倍），可安全接触的", "时间减半；受损的毛细胞无法再生。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{音色与谐音}", "", "\\begin{definition}[谐音]\\label{def:g12:sound-acoustics:harmonics}", "频率为 $f_1$ 的周期性声音 --- 其", "\\emph{基音}\\index{基音} --- 一般是", "若干频率为 $f_n = n f_1$，$n = 1, 2, 3, \\dots$ 的正弦波之和，其", "\\emph{谐音}\\index{谐音}。仅含基音的声音", "为\\emph{纯音}\\index{纯音}，如音叉所发之声。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[频谱与音色]\\label{def:g12:sound-acoustics:timbre}", "声音的\\emph{频谱}\\index{频谱}是其谐音的柱状图：", "每个 $f_n$ 对应一根柱，柱高为该谐音的", "强度。耳朵把 $f_1$ 感知为音调，把各谐音强度的\\emph{配比}", "感知为\\emph{音色}\\index{音色} --- 即声音的", "“色彩”：演奏同一音符的乐器共享 $f_1$，", "区别仅在于各自的频谱。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\node at (1.45,1.0) {长笛}; \\node at (5.85,1.0) {小提琴};", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.1,0) -- (3.1,0) node[below] {$t$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, smooth, samples=120, domain=0:2.9]", "    plot (\\x, {0.55*sin(248*\\x)});", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.4cm]", "    \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.1,0) -- (3.1,0) node[below] {$t$};", "    \\draw[omDef, thick, smooth, samples=160, domain=0:2.9]", "      plot (\\x, {0.30*sin(248*\\x)+0.18*sin(496*\\x)", "        +0.12*sin(744*\\x)+0.08*sin(992*\\x)});", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=-3.3cm]", "    \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.1,0) -- (3.1,0) node[below] {$f$ (\\unit{Hz})};", "    \\foreach \\k/\\h in {1/1.15, 2/0.10, 3/0.05} \\fill[omProp!80]", "      ({0.35+0.55*(\\k-1)-0.09},0) rectangle ({0.35+0.55*(\\k-1)+0.09},\\h);", "    \\foreach \\k/\\l in {1/220, 2/440, 3/660, 4/880, 5/1100}", "      \\node[below] at ({0.35+0.55*(\\k-1)},0) {\\scriptsize \\l};", "    \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.4cm]", "      \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.1,0) -- (3.1,0) node[below] {$f$ (\\unit{Hz})};", "      \\foreach \\k/\\h in {1/0.80, 2/0.55, 3/0.38, 4/0.26, 5/0.18}", "        \\fill[omProp!80] ({0.35+0.55*(\\k-1)-0.09},0)", "          rectangle ({0.35+0.55*(\\k-1)+0.09},\\h);", "      \\foreach \\k/\\l in {1/220, 2/440, 3/660, 4/880, 5/1100}", "        \\node[below] at ({0.35+0.55*(\\k-1)},0) {\\scriptsize \\l};", "    \\end{scope}", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 同一 A 音（\\qty{220}{Hz}）：波形（上）、频谱", "（下）--- 基音与音调相同；小提琴的谐音", "阶梯即其音色。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[为何能听出来电者]\\label{ex:g12:sound-acoustics:two-instruments}", "长笛的 A 音接近纯音；小提琴拉奏同样的", "\\qty{220}{Hz} 音时，在 \\qtylist{440;660;880}{Hz} 处叠加强烈的谐音。", "音调与响度相同，却没有人会把它们混淆：人声也是", "一种你早已熟悉的频谱。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{振动的弦}", "", "\\begin{definition}[驻波]\\label{def:g12:sound-acoustics:standing-wave}", "被限制在弦两固定端之间的波可以形成", "\\emph{驻波}\\index{驻波}：原地振动，", "静止的点 --- \\emph{波节}\\index{波节} --- 与", "振幅最大的点 --- \\emph{波腹}\\index{波腹} --- 交替排列。", "不再有波动传播，弦以固定的模式振动。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[弦的振动模式]\\label{prop:g12:sound-acoustics:string-modes}", "长为 $L$、两端固定的弦上，传播速度为", "$v$ 的波，弦只有在能恰好容纳整数 $n$", "个半波长、且半波长位于两端的波节之间时，弦才能稳定振动：", "\\[ \\lambda_n = \\frac{2L}{n}, \\quad f_n = n\\,\\frac{v}{2L} = n f_1, \\quad n = 1, 2, 3, \\dots \\]", "最低模式 $f_1 = v/(2L)$ 为基音；其余模式", "恰好是它的谐音。\\admitted", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}